          "title": "You'll want to know: কিস্তি",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কিস্তি — kisti — \"an instalment\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অরুণ সাইকেলটা কিস্তিতে কিনল। ôrun sāikelṭā kistite kinlô. Arun bought the bicycle in instalments."
            }
