          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কিস্তি (kisti) is usually traced to Arabic qisṭ, \"a share, a portion\", through Persian qist, \"an instalment\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
