              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কাজ শেষ করে মিস্ত্রি তার পাওনা চাইলেন। kāj shesh kore mistri tār pāonā chāilen. When the job was done, the mechanic asked for what he was owed."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The pair দেনা (denā) and পাওনা (pāonā), what you owe and what you are owed, often go together."
